    description: 'Consider the number triangle shown below. Write a program that calculates the highest sum of numbers that can be passed on a route that starts at the top and ends somewhere on the base. Each step can go either diagonally down to the left or diagonally down to the right.\n\n![](https://cdn.luogu.com.cn/upload/image_hosting/95pzs0ne.png)\n\nIn the sample above, the route from $7$ to $3$ to $8$ to $7$ to $5$ produces the highest sum: $30$.\n\n**输入格式：**\nThe first line contains $R$ ($1 \\le R \\le 1000$), the number of rows. Each subsequent line contains the integers for that particular row of the triangle. All the supplied integers are non-negative and no larger than $100$.\n\n**输出格式：**\nA single line containing the largest sum using the traversal specified.',
